    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "OWNER DIRECTIVE UPDATE — MARKETING/SALES MATHEMATICS + OSS-FIRST\n\nMarketing/sales mathematics is now a core pillar of tracker #222, not a secondary topic.\n\nDurable research additions on branch `research/zorr-studio-mathematics-r01`:\n- `docs/research/studio-mathematics/MARKETING_SALES_MATHEMATICS_R01.md`\n- `docs/research/studio-mathematics/OPEN_SOURCE_MARKETING_MATH_STACK_R01.md`\n\nCore commercial chain:\n`PRODUCT QUALITY -> ATTENTION -> INTEREST -> INTENT -> CONVERSION -> REVENUE -> CONTRIBUTION MARGIN -> RETENTION/REPEAT/LICENSING -> REINVESTMENT`\n\nResearch must model demand, price elasticity, funnel conversion, causal incrementality, MMM, saturation/adstock, CAC/LTV with uncertainty, retention/survival, creative experiments, budget allocation and launch/release decisions.\n\nHARD OSS-FIRST LAW:\n`EXISTING ZORR CODE -> STANDARD/NATIVE -> MATURE OPEN SOURCE -> MINIMAL ZORR GLUE`.\n\nInitial OSS map to inspect/verify per exact use case, version/ref/license/tests before adoption:\n- Google Meridian — MMM/media response/budget optimization;\n- EconML OR CausalML — causal ML/uplift/heterogeneous treatment effects;\n- PyMC — Bayesian/hierarchical uncertainty models;\n- SciPy/statsmodels/lifelines — statistics, time series, censored/survival analysis;\n- OR-Tools — constrained optimization/allocation;\n- NetworkX — graph models;\n- scikit-learn — baselines/calibration.\n\nDo not build custom MMM, attribution, causal-ML, Bayesian-sampler, survival, optimization, experiment-statistics, forecasting, CRM, or marketing-database frameworks without a proven gap.\n\nNo marketing budget, pricing, sales forecast, channel allocation or production-commercial effectiveness is canon/approved from research alone. Missing empirical coefficients/thresholds remain UNKNOWN until measured.\n\nContinuous hourly research automation has been updated so marketing/sales mathematics and OSS source inspection are mandatory parts of the research line.",
